################################################################################
#
# SKWIFI NV (Non-Volatile) Files
#
# This directory contains NV files required for the SKW (Seekwave)
# WiFi/BT module calibration and configuration.
#
# IMPORTANT: These proprietary NV files are stored in the sibling
# operating-system-blobs repository, under seekwave/swt6652/nv.
#
# Required Files:
# ---------------
# 1. SEEKWAVE_NV_SWT6652.bin - NV data for SV6160/SWT6652 module
# 2. Other platform-specific NV files as needed
#
# How to Obtain:
# --------------
# Method 1: From SDK
#   The NV files are located in the SDK at:
#   /path/to/rockchip_sdk/external/rkwifibt/nv/
#
# Method 2: From Seekwave
#   Contact Seekwave directly to obtain the NV files.
#
# Installation:
# -------------
# The SKWIFI package installs these files into /lib/firmware/.
#
# Note: The NV file name should match the compatible string in the
# device tree: "seekwave,sv6160"
#
################################################################################
